# Task close summary (mandatory — every completed task)

**Status:** User preference 2026-07-29 (§9.5, §9.7); **앞으로 할 일** 2026-07-29; **로드맵** at end 2026-07-29. Complements `.cursor/rules/brief-korean-replies.mdc` and `.cursor/rules/explain-before-fix.mdc`.

## When

At the **end of every completed user task** — after work is done (or when closing a docs/policy-only task). **One block per task**, not every chat message.

**Not required** mid-task unless the user asks “설명만” / “요약해줘”.

## Language and tone

- **Korean only**, **초보자 눈높이** — everyday words; no class/file names, JSON keys, or English jargon unless the user asked for technical detail.
- **Short** — each line is one sentence or a very short phrase; **no long tables**.

## Required block (6 labels — use these labels)

| Line | Label | Content |
| ---- | ----- | ------- |
| 1 | **원인** | What was wrong or what was requested (1 sentence). Bug: what you felt; feature: what you wanted. |
| 2 | **해결** | What we changed or decided (1–2 short sentences). Outcome, not implementation detail. |
| 3 | **이번에 할 일** | What **you** should do **now** — **1–3 bullets max** (e.g. F5로 새 버전 실행, 한 번 재현 확인, 설정 켜기). Say “없음” for pure docs/policy with no immediate user action. |
| 4 | **앞으로 할 일** | What comes **next** — **1–3 bullets max**: manual checks still open, “다음에 … 해줘” hints. Say “없음” when the thread is fully closed. |
| 5 | **한줄** | Single-line recap tying cause + result. |
| 6 | **로드맵** | **Always last.** Read [AGENTS.md §8.21](../../AGENTS.md#821-architecture-stabilization-roadmap-mandatory--ai-execution) **Progress tracker** table at task close; tell the user in **1–2 short Korean sentences** which phases are **완료 / 진행 중 / 미착수** and what the agent would pick next (lowest Partial/Not started). Plain names only (e.g. “GUI·워커 경계”, “캡처 계약”) — no § numbers in user text unless they asked for docs. |

Example shape (content varies):

```
**원인** …
**해결** …
**이번에 할 일** · …
**앞으로 할 일** · …
**한줄** …
**로드맵** · …
```

## Relation to other rules

| Rule | Difference |
| ---- | ---------- |
| `explain-before-fix.mdc` | **Before** code/build on **bug reports** — diagnosis only until user saw it. |
| `task-close-summary.mdc` | **After** task complete — recap, user actions, next steps, **roadmap snapshot**. |
| `architecture-stabilization-roadmap.mdc` | **During** stability work — full §8.21 plan; task close **로드맵** line is the user-facing snapshot. |
| `app-stutter-profiling.mdc` | Log readouts use 6 bullets; task close still ends with this 6-part block when the task closes. |

